<title>UK: Timah at 16.9 in London at 0827 GMT.</title>
<headline>Timah at 16.9 in London at 0827 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Tambang Timah was traded at $16.9 per GDR in London on Tuesday at around 0827 GMT.</p>
<p>It recorded a low of $16.8750 and a high of $16.995.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Monday was $16.95.</p>
<p>One Global Depository Receipt represents 10 common shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
